  "source": "package",
  "name": "Siril savetif8",
  "description": "Same command as SAVETIF but the output file is saved in 8-bit per channel: filename .tif. The option -astro allows saving in Astro-TIFF format, while -deflate enables compression\n\nLinks: savetif\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
